--- body ---
## Context

Child of tickets/0205. Re-scoped 2026-06-05 (ACP/A2A dig, author
session): the original plan drove aider as the reviewer engine, but
aider's value-add is an edit-and-commit loop — exactly what a read-only
reviewer must forbid — while its endpoint connectivity is a trivial
OpenAI-compatible HTTP call. Replaced by a thin FIRST-PARTY agent
speaking the Agent Client Protocol (ACP): the verify orchestrator acts
as ACP client (tickets/0208) and grants fs/read only, so containment is
by capability omission, not prompt discipline. Decorrelation lives in
the model, not the CLI around it: one agent, N models via {endpoint,
model} config — OpenRouter-hosted frontier models, or a fully local,
free, private llama-server. The experiment matrix stays configuration,
not code. Helper is tool-NAMED per the 0205 naming exception.

## Credential path (unchanged, decided before implementation)

OPENROUTER_API_KEY loads via the BASH_ENV -> bash-env.sh pattern — never
argv, never CLAUDE_ENV_FILE (argv leaks to ps -ef). llama-server endpoint
is plain config (host:port), no secret.

## Relevant files

- new agent: skills/reviewers/model-reviewer-acp (tool-named; pure I/O;
  contains NO write path in code — the seat is also denied fs/write by
  the 0208 client, two independent layers)
- skills/verify/SKILL.md — panel-extension section (from 0205)
- ~/.claude/scripts/bash-env.sh — credential loading reference

## Actions

1. Implement the agent: ACP initialize / session/new / session/prompt
   over stdio; repo content read only via client-mediated
   fs/read_text_file; single-shot review (diff + ticket + guidelines in
   the prompt) returning findings in the 0205 contract shape
   (verifiable:/consider: + file:line + rationale). Config per seat:
   {base_url, model, api_key_env}. A read-loop (model requests files
   through the client) is a later upgrade, not v1.
2. Smoke both configs manually on one merged PR (no gate wiring yet):
   record model used, latency, finding quality in this ticket's log.
3. Wire as advisory seat behind the 0208 ACP client harness, per 0205's
   contract (gate dispositions findings; only verifiable-class may
   bounce).
4. Advisory trial: at least 5 merge requests across at least 3 projects
   PER CONFIG (OpenRouter, llama-server) — scorecard lines in this log.

## Test

tests/test_model_reviewer_acp.sh: stub OpenAI-compatible endpoint
emitting a canned completion; drive one ACP session over stdio; assert
the normalized findings shape, that fs/write_text_file is never
requested, and non-zero exit when the endpoint is unreachable
(fail-loud).

## Exit criteria

- [ ] Thin ACP reviewer agent exists, tool-named, no write path in code, credentials via BASH_ENV path only
- [ ] Both endpoint configs smoke-tested and logged
- [ ] Advisory trial: ≥5 MRs, ≥3 projects per config, scorecards logged
- [ ] Promote/drop recommendation recorded for 0205's integration review
